    "description": "This course introduces fundamental concepts of data structures and algorithms, emphasizing linear structures such as arrays, linked lists, stacks, and queues. Students learn recursion, complexity analysis, and sorting techniques, progressing toward practical applications. Through coding practice and a project, learners develop problem-solving, analytical, and teamwork skills essential for data science and engineering."
